        "content": "<p>dsecurity49 opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15108\">PR #15108</a> from <code>dsecurity49:fix-scratch-reg-clobber-stack-limit</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Fixes #14946</p>\n<p>Avoids clobbering base and scratch registers on AArch64 and RISC-V when materializing large offsets that exceed immediate ranges (such as in nested stack limit checks). When the base or source register is already the default scratch register, select the secondary scratch register instead.</p>\n<p>Includes precise-output compile filetests and unit tests.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
